msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Minori「......!」"
msgstr "Minori「......!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't run away!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No huyas!」"

msgid "Minori「As if I could! ......Sorry, please give me a＿second......!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Como si pudiera! ......¡Perdón, dame＿un segundo, por favor......!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Minori「Goddamn it, WHY!? Why did this have＿to happen......!?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Maldición! ¿POR QUÉ? ¿Por qué＿tuvo que pasar esto......!?」"

msgid "Minori「......Sorry. I'm really sorry...... I didn't＿intend to...... I didn't mean to start＿crying.」"
msgstr "Minori「......Perdón. De verdad perdón......＿No quería...... No era mi intención＿ponerme a llorar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's fine.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien.」"

msgid "Minori「I...... really, really do put Taiga first...... If＿I could, I'd always be there for her......＿But I know that's impossible.」"
msgstr "Minori「Yo...... de verdad pongo primero a＿Taiga...... Si pudiera, estaría siempre＿ahí...... Pero sé que es imposible.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't worry about me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No te preocupes por mí.」"

msgid "Minori「In the end, I guess I was just running＿away...... Sorry. I'm sorry, Takasu-kun......」"
msgstr "Minori「Al final, supongo que solo estaba＿huyendo...... Perdón. Perdóname,＿Takasu-kun......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hey, Kushieda......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oye, Kushieda......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「If you regret running away, then won't＿you...... let me say what I wanted to tell＿you that day?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Si te arrepientes de huir, entonces＿¿me dejarías...... decirte lo que＿quería decirte ese día?」"

msgid "Minori「......Huh?」"
msgstr "Minori「......¿Eh?」"

msgid "Minori「............」"
msgstr "Minori「............」"

msgid "Minori「......Yeah, but first, I have a favor to ask.」"
msgstr "Minori「......Sí, pero antes tengo＿un favor que pedirte.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......What is it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Qué es?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......No.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Regrets it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Se arrepiente?」"

msgid "Minori「Yeah...... She was sobbing.」"
msgstr "Minori「Sí...... Estaba sollozando.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Minori「After you remember...... I'll listen to＿what you have to say, Takasu-kun. I＿promise.」"
msgstr "Minori「Cuando lo recuerdes...... escucharé＿lo que tienes que decir, Takasu-kun.＿Lo prometo.」"

msgid "Minori「Eventually we'll go our separate＿ways...... But you know how she is,＿right? She's awkward, clumsy......」"
msgstr "Minori「Con el tiempo cada quien seguirá su＿camino...... Pero ya sabes cómo es ella,＿¿no? Es torpe, tosca......」"

msgid "Minori「genuine, fragile......」"
msgstr "Minori「sincera, frágil......」"

msgid "Minori「That's why I need to help Taiga find＿happiness...... do my best to make Taiga＿happy...... lend a hand when she loses」"
msgstr "Minori「Por eso debo ayudar a Taiga a ser＿feliz...... esforzarme para hacerla＿feliz...... darle la mano si pierde」"

msgid "Minori「her way......」"
msgstr "Minori「el camino......」"

msgid "Minori「But when I try to make things work, it＿always backfires, and I end up making＿Taiga sad over and over...... I end up」"
msgstr "Minori「Pero cuando intento arreglar todo, sale＿mal y termino entristeciendo a Taiga＿una y otra vez...... Termino」"

msgid "Minori「hating my own stupidity...... and hurting＿you......」"
msgstr "Minori「odiando mi propia estupidez......＿y lastimándote a ti......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I mean, I already know the answer, so＿I'm not concerned about that, but at＿this rate, I won't be able to show my」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Digo, ya sé la respuesta, así que＿eso no me preocupa, pero a este＿paso no podré mostrarle la」"

msgid "Ryuuji「face around Taiga.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「cara a Taiga.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, I'm not asking you to rethink your＿answer or anything. I'll just say it, and＿then you can shoot me down...... I admit」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, no te pido que reconsideres tu＿respuesta ni nada. Solo lo diré y luego＿puedes rechazarme...... Admito」"

msgid "Ryuuji「it's a strange request.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「que es una petición rara.」"

msgid "Minori「Takasu-kun, on the night of Christmas＿Eve, before you met with me, you were＿probably with Taiga...... Did you」"
msgstr "Minori「Takasu-kun, en Nochebuena, antes＿de verte conmigo, seguro estuviste＿con Taiga...... ¿Ya」"

msgid "Minori「remember that?」"
msgstr "Minori「recordaste eso?」"

msgid "Minori「I see...... In that case, I want you to＿remember what happened back then＿first. Taiga probably really regrets it,」"
msgstr "Minori「Ya veo...... En ese caso, quiero que＿primero recuerdes lo que pasó entonces.＿Seguro Taiga se arrepiente mucho,」"

msgid "Minori「after all.」"
msgstr "Minori「después de todo.」"
